  m_text: "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\xDCcretsiz Plan:\nAyda 60 dakikaya kadar i\u015Flem s\xFCresi\nFiligranl\u0131
    \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\nTemel \xF6zelliklere eri\u015Fim\n\nPro Plan:\nAyl\u0131k
    19 Dolar\nS\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z video i\u015Fleme\nFiligrans\u0131z \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\nGeli\u015Fmi\u015F
    \xF6zellikler\n\nBusiness Plan:\nTak\u0131mlar ve ajanslar i\xE7in\nAPI ve \xF6zel
    entegrasyon deste\u011Fi\nFiyat \xF6zel olarak belirlenir"
